      boxedWarning: "High-yield warning context: current UBRELVY labeling has no boxed warning. It is contraindicated with strong CYP3A4 inhibitors because exposure rises markedly and in patients with serious ubrogepant hypersensitivity. Anaphylaxis can occur within minutes to days; monitor new/worsening hypertension and Raynaud phenomenon and avoid strong CYP3A inducers that can eliminate efficacy.",
