      contraindications: ["Contraindicated after serious hypersensitivity to atogepant or an excipient.", "Avoid severe hepatic impairment. Severe renal impairment and end-stage renal disease require indication-specific limits; treatment of chronic migraine is not recommended in that setting because the studied regimen and exposure do not support safe extrapolation."],
      interactions: ["Strong CYP3A inhibitors require dose reduction. CYP3A inducers can lower exposure and OATP inhibitors can raise it, with different recommendations for episodic versus chronic migraine.", "The interaction changes how much active drug reaches the receptor; do not transfer a dose table from rimegepant or ubrogepant simply because all are gepants."],
