      nursingEssentials: ["Do not prime or test spray: remove one device only when ready and deliver its single spray into one nostril. Maximum is one device in 24 hours, and safety for treating more than 8 attacks in 30 days is unestablished.", "Assess nasal technique, taste disturbance, nausea/vomiting, hypersensitivity, blood pressure, digital perfusion, renal/hepatic function, transporter interactions and headache red flags."],
